      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The upcoming autumn/winter season signals a sophisticated shift toward tactile luxury and redefined power dressing. We are moving beyond minimalist structures into richly textured surfaces—think brushed wools, heavy jacquards, and unexpected leather treatments that offer substantial visual depth. Silhouette-wise, there's a tension between dramatically oversized, enveloping outerwear and sharply tailored, almost aggressively cinched pieces, speaking to a desire for both comfort and control. This market movement suggests consumers are prioritizing investment pieces that offer narrative and physical presence over fleeting micro-trends.",
